    "text": "By WKYT News Staff ,\n4 hours ago LAUREL COUNTY, Ky. (WKYT) - The sheriff in an Eastern Kentucky community believes his agency should not be tied to a controversial arrest. London Mayor Randall Weddle recently said that the City of London Police and Laurel County Sheriff’s deputies failed to de-escalate the arrest of a man with autism effectively. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
